 premiks üreticileri ve entegre çiftçilik operasyonları</strong>.</p><hr data-start="1179" data-end="1182" /><h2 data-start="1184" data-end="1214">Teknik Özellikler</h2><div class="_tableContainer_1rjym_1"><div class="group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse" tabindex="-1"><table class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="1216" data-end="2049"><thead data-start="1216" data-end="1255"><tr data-start="1216" data-end="1255"><th data-start="1216" data-end="1240" data-col-size="sm"><strong data-start="1218" data-end="1230">Kategori</strong></th><th data-start="1240" data-end="1255" data-col-size="md"><strong data-start="1242" data-end="1253">Detaylar</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1297" data-end="2049"><tr data-start="1297" data-end="1372"><td data-start="1297" data-end="1322" data-col-size="sm">Eşanlamlılar</td><td data-start="1322" data-end="1372" data-col-size="md">2-Hidroksi-N, N, N-Trimetiletanaminyum Klorür</td></tr><tr data-start="1373" data-end="1409"><td data-start="1373" data-end="1398" data-col-size="sm">CAS No.</td><td data-start="1398" data-end="1409" data-col-size="md">67-48-1</td></tr><tr data-start="1410" data-end="1458"><td data-start="1410" data-end="1435" data-col-size="sm">Moleküler Formül</td><td data-start="1435" data-end="1458" data-col-size="md">[HOCH₂CH₂(CH₃)₃N]Cl</td></tr><tr data-start="1459" data-end="1500"><td data-start="1459" data-end="1484" data-col-size="sm">Moleküler Ağırlık</td><td data-start="1484" data-end="1500" data-col-size="md">139,63 g/mol</td></tr><tr data-start="1501" data-end="1564"><td data-start="1501" data-end="1526" data-col-size="sm">Görünüş</td><td data-start="1526" data-end="1564" data-col-size="md">Serbest akışlı, açık kahverengi granüller</td></tr><tr data-start="1565" data-end="1611"><td data-start="1565" data-end="1590" data-col-size="sm">Koku</td><td data-start="1590" data-end="1611" data-col-size="md">Hafif amin kokusu</td></tr>